,70,70,70,70,70,70,70,70,70,70,70,70,70],"nar":[{"lap":0,"text":"At 3:00 PM Senator Crespi, escorted by Conte Vincenzo Florio, lowered the flag. Stuck in the light-blue Austro Daimler took the immediate lead with Brilli Peri on his heels","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":20},{"lap":0,"text":"At 3:00 PM Senator Crespi, escorted by Conte Vincenzo Florio, lowered the flag. Stuck in the light-blue Austro Daimler took the immediate lead with Brilli Peri on his heels","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":20},{"lap":1,"text":"Stuck leads after the first lap in 6m10.6s from Brilli Peri, Varzi and Borzacchini.","q":false,"c":20},{"lap":1,"text":"Stuck leads after the first lap in 6m10.6s from Brilli Peri, Varzi and Borzacchini.","q":false,"c":20},{"lap":2,"text":"After the second lap in an amazing 5m52.6s, Stuck held on to first place in 12m3.2s after his full throttle sprint, ahead of Brilli in 12m28s, Varzi in 12m31s, Borzacchini in 12m36.2s","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":20},{"lap":2,"text":"After the second lap in an amazing 5m52.6s, Stuck held on to first place in 12m3.2s after his full throttle sprint, ahead of Brilli in 12m28s, Varzi in 12m31s, Borzacchini in 12m36.2s","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":20},{"lap":3,"text":"Stuck's engine loses power and Varzi takes the lead from Brilli Peri, Stuck and Borzacchini.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":3,"text":"Stuck's engine loses power and Varzi takes the lead from Brilli Peri, Stuck and Borzacchini.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":5,"text":"Stuck pits to change plugs and work on the engine lubrication.","q":false,"c":20},{"lap":5,"text":"Stuck pits to change plugs and work on the engine lubrication.","q":false,"c":20},{"lap":6,"text":"Blancas had retired his Bugatti on lap six.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":21},{"lap":6,"text":"Borzacchini crashed his Maserati on the same lap while trying to pass another car in a corner. His Maserati left the road and turned over in a ditch.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":22},{"lap":6,"text":"Blancas had retired his Bugatti on lap six.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":21},{"lap":6,"text":"Borzacchini crashed his Maserati on the same lap while trying to pass another car in a corner. His Maserati left the road and turned over in a ditch.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":22},{"lap":7,"text":"Stuck retires his Austro Daimler; Bouriano moves up to third and Nuvolari fourth.","q":false,"c":20},{"lap":7,"text":"Stuck retires his Austro Daimler; Bouriano moves up to third and Nuvolari fourth.","q":false,"c":20},{"lap":9,"text":"Sartorio had retired his Amilcar on lap nine when spinning out of the first corner in a cloud of dust.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":19},{"lap":9,"text":"Fisauli retired his Maserati on the same lap.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":18},{"lap":9,"text":"Sartorio had retired his Amilcar on lap nine when spinning out of the first corner in a cloud of dust.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":19},{"lap":9,"text":"Fisauli retired his Maserati on the same lap.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":18},{"lap":10,"text":"Momberger retired his Mercedes-Benz on the tenth lap due to a broken supercharger.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":17},{"lap":10,"text":"Momberger retired his Mercedes-Benz on the tenth lap due to a broken supercharger.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":17},{"lap":11,"text":"Brilli Peri laps in 5m51.2s, a new lap record.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":11,"text":"Brilli Peri laps in 5m51.2s, a new lap record.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":14,"text":"On the fourteenth lap the cars began to head for the pits for refueling and changing wheels. Many cars stopped with boiling radiators and required a water refill.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":14,"text":"When Anselmi retired his Alfa Romeo on lap 14, the field was down to 16 cars.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":16},{"lap":14,"text":"On the fourteenth lap the cars began to head for the pits for refueling and changing wheels. Many cars stopped with boiling radiators and required a water refill.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":14,"text":"When Anselmi retired his Alfa Romeo on lap 14, the field was down to 16 cars.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":16},{"lap":15,"text":"After 15 laps Varzi was 15 seconds ahead of Brilli Peri while Divo held third place when stopping to refuel.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":15,"text":"Nuvolari had pitted his Bugatti on lap 15, apparently with engine trouble.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":13},{"lap":15,"text":"After 15 laps Varzi was 15 seconds ahead of Brilli Peri while Divo held third place when stopping to refuel.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":15,"text":"Nuvolari had pitted his Bugatti on lap 15, apparently with engine trouble.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":13},{"lap":16,"text":"Fagioli retires.","q":false,"c":15},{"lap":16,"text":"Fagioli retires.","q":false,"c":15},{"lap":17,"text":"Bouriano retires.","q":false,"c":14},{"lap":17,"text":"Bouriano retires.","q":false,"c":14},{"lap":18,"text":"Nuvolari calls it quits.","q":false,"c":13},{"lap":18,"text":"Nuvolari calls it quits.","q":false,"c":13},{"lap":21,"text":"Varzi pits for fuel and oil, 2m35s; Brilli Peri takes the lead by about 1m30s.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":21,"text":"Divo also rushed in with his Bugatti and needed only 10 seconds for a quick burst of fuel but he was still about nine minutes behind Varzi.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":21,"text":"Varzi pits for fuel and oil, 2m35s; Brilli Peri takes the lead by about 1m30s.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":21,"text":"Divo also rushed in with his Bugatti and needed only 10 seconds for a quick burst of fuel but he was still about nine minutes behind Varzi.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":22,"text":"After 22 laps Brilli was leading Varzi by 1m25s.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":22,"text":"After 22 laps Brilli was leading Varzi by 1m25s.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":25,"text":"After 25 laps Brilli was still 1m11s ahead of Varzi.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":25,"text":"After 25 laps Brilli was still 1m11s ahead of Varzi.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":27,"text":"Ernesto Maserati retired on lap 27 while Lepori also called it quits.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":27,"text":"In the meantime Varzi drove every lap faster than his teammate, continuously reducing Brilli Peri's advantage.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":27,"text":"After the twenty-seventh lap Brilli's advantage had come down to 1m08s.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":27,"text":"Ernesto Maserati retired on lap 27 while Lepori also called it quits.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":27,"text":"In the meantime Varzi drove every lap faster than his teammate, continuously reducing Brilli Peri's advantage.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":27,"text":"After the twenty-seventh lap Brilli's advantage had come down to 1m08s.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":28,"text":"Finally, on the twenty-eighth lap, with only two more laps to go, he came in.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":28,"text":"His stop had lasted a mere 30 seconds but then Varzi arrived. The pair hurled towards the first turn with Varzi in front.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":28,"text":"Finally, on the twenty-eighth lap, with only two more laps to go, he came in.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":28,"text":"His stop had lasted a mere 30 seconds but then Varzi arrived. The pair hurled towards the first turn with Varzi in front.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":30,"text":"Varzi wins, 47 seconds ahead of Brilli Peri.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":30,"text":"Divo followed over ten minutes behind in third place, ahead of the 1500 cc class winner Arcangeli, Caflisch who made several stops for tires and Pintacuda who had been delayed with spark plug problems.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":30,"text":"Varzi wins, 47 seconds ahead of Brilli Peri.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":30,"text":"Divo followed over ten minutes behind in third place, ahead of the 1500 cc class winner Arcangeli, Caflisch who made several stops for tires and Pintacuda who had been delayed with spark plug problems.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2}]}